            y: 7,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_8",
        on: "branch_if_8",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "quintain_killers.length",
            greater_than: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Hey, rookie. I’m all out of quintains, so if you want more bruises you’ll have to find another inanimate object to fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("...but I guess you’re asking about my skills, not yours. You never did get a chance to see me fight."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_9",
        on: "branch_if_9",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "quintain_killers.length",
            less_than_or_equal_to: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Hey, rookie. Yeah, you never did get a chance to see me fight."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_7",
        on: "branch_if_7",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_mari",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "asked_mari",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_8",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Well, I’m a survivor. Fast-moving, light on my feet; good at evading, good at stabbing. Hard to pin down, whether in an attack or in an escape."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Mari has unusually high terrain defenses (her chance to evade enemy attacks). Her <i><b>skirmisher</b></i> ability lets her ignore enemies’ Zone of Control — she can move freely around enemy units without being stopped.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Got a pretty good sling too, ’cuz there aren’t many ranged weapons that can be loaded one-handed. Altogether, I’ll bet I could outlast both Hylas and Gerrick in a 1-on-1. And you too, but that goes without saying."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("And... if you come with me you’ll actually help fight? No more training, or observing, or running off right before the battle starts?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Of course. Highwaymen are one thing, but necromancy is serious business. I just thought... well, after losing one arm to undead in the Estmarks, I hoped I was done dealing with this sort of thing."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_10",
        on: "branch_if_10",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_mari",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("I already told you, didn’t I? Pay attention this time — I’ve got a sword and sling, skill at evading attacks, and can move freely around enemies without being stopped."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "ask_about_mari",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_7",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_10",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_hylas",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "asked_hylas",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("I am a man of medicine, Lieutenant Deoran. The light within me can <i><b>heal adjacent units</b></i> just as quickly as can resting in a village. This doesn’t stack with healing from villages or other healers, however."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("In ranged combat, I also wield a highly accurate <i><b>magical</b></i> attack. Magical attacks always have a high chance to hit and are unaffected by terrain, making them ideal against evasive or fortified enemies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I don’t mean to be rude, but... your leg looks badly injured. If you have healing magic, shouldn’t you have been able to cure it?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("Born twisted, I’m afraid. At the time there was no healer in Westin, and the bones set poorly. Such was the greater part of my motivation for traveling to the Isle of Alduin and studying the arcane arts — an opportunity to return home and offer to others the services that I never had."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("I’ve long-ago accepted my impairment. But as my potential commander, you should know that it does somewhat slow my movement on the battlefield, even more so than is Sir Gerrick by his armor."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_13",
        on: "branch_if_13",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_hylas",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("Forgotten already? I can heal adjacent units for a moderate amount every turn. I wield a ranged magical attack that is highly accurate, irrespective of the terrain my opponent occupies."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "ask_about_hylas",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_12",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_13",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_15",
        on: "branch_if_15",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_gerrick",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "asked_gerrick",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Well lad, I’m a monster in melee, if you’ll forgive me the brag. My glaive hits harder than any spear, an’ my crushin’ shield bash can <i><b>slow</b></i> enemies."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Slowed enemies move at <i><b>half speed</b></i> and deal <i><b>half damage</b></i>.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("An’ while my armor may be heavy an’ cumbersome, it also gives me great <i><b>resistance</b></i> against bladed or piercing weapons. If you need someone t’ break an enemy line, I’m your man."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_16",
        on: "branch_if_16",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "asked_gerrick",
            equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Well, like I said, I’ve got great damage resistance on account o’ me heavy armor, an’ I can slow enemies t’ halve both their speed an’ damage. Try not t’ forget this time!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "ask_about_gerrick",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_15",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "leave_with_mari",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("I’ve decided: Captain Mari, I’d like you to accompany me on our mission to the elven vale. Make ready the men — we leave at next dawn!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Good luck, Deoran an’ Mari. We’re countin’ on you to stop the bandits an’ undead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "companion_id",
            value: "Mari",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "companion_name",
            value: "Captain Mari",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
