          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Minister_Hylas",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Minister_Hylas",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("The Vale of Blossoming Trees."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Minister Hylas",
            x: 29,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("Other than that singular piece of information, I regret to report that Urza Fastik remains as recalcitrant as the day we first arrived. Whether “The Vale of Blossoming Trees” refers to the source of his dark powers, the location of another Urza brother, or something else entirely, I cannot say."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("The vale... isn’t that an Aethenwood exclave? I can’t imagine the Aethenwood elves would have anything to do with necromancy, or ever offer aid to bandits... I hear they’re aloof even with regards to the king. Can we not learn more from our captive?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("I say we’re treatin’ him too gentle. Man like Fastik — he’s plenty used to roughing it. Lives are at stake, an’ too much coddling ain’t getting us nowhere."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("I fear there is a corruption in his soul, darker than even my light can illuminate. Now deprived of the dark magic that once suffused him, his very mind has begun to fade away."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("Even were he willing, I am not sure he remembers anything other than what he has already told us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Mari",
            type: "Veteran Fencer",
            side: 1,
            x: 42,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Mari",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Mari",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Mari",
            x: 40,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Hey, everyone. I’m done cleaning up the last of Fastik’s mess, but no trace of the other two brothers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Mari",
            x: 28,
