            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Thanks, Hylas. Shouldn’t there be a duke or prince or something around here? How did things get this bad?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Aye, officially these lands belong to Prince Arand; King Garard’s younger brother. Arand’s been tryin’ to build the place up. Last time he visited, His Highness said our home might someday be called the Jewel of the South!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("But the kingdom is large, the prince has many holdings, an’ today Westin be but a small town. These Urza outlaws ha’ always been a nuisance, but once they somehow started raisin’ the dead things got out of hand, fast."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Minister Hylas",
            text: _("We dispatched messengers carrying word of our plight, only to have them intercepted on the road or waylaid at river crossings. You are the first contact we have had with the crown in some time, sirs Mari and Deoran. With your aid, we can defeat these outlaws and cleanse their undead."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Well, if we don’t have any other leads, then we’ll need to investigate this “Vale of Blossoming Trees” and hope it’s neither misdirection nor a trap. Sirs, do I have your permissions to take the infantry on a sortie?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Sir Gerrick",
            x: 27,
            y: 8,
