          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Offerin’ to command the mission? Brave lad, but you shan’t have to go alone. Two o’ us officers will need to stay here and watch th’ town, but at least one o’ us should come with ye to help fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Take yer pick — either me, Minister Hylas, or tha’ Mari o’ yers. You don’t know much about how each of us fight yet, so ask and we’ll tell!"),
